  "design": "All official TUT evaluation recordings from 2016 and 2017. The 2017 street set had been used previously. One WAV (a009) in the 2016 residential and 2017 street sets is byte-identical. The original labels differ by release. Count each release separately. Annotations cover the specified scene vocabulary. Other audible sources can exist.",
