  },
  "unprompted_and_prompted": "Count (second, scene category) pairs on half-open one-second bins, including the final partial second. A nonempty overlap marks a bin. Columns count matched, extra and missed. YAMNet uses the shipping threshold .5 and up to 3 labels per channel/window. Frame-MN06 uses sigmoid >.5 and a 9-frame median. PE-A-Frame uses sigmoid >.3 independently per prompt/channel at 40 ms, in nonoverlapping 10-second input contexts trimmed to original samples. Catalogue uses all 521 names prefixed with \"the sound of \". Prompted uses every category description in both releases. Credit either original channel. Fixed mappings include empty lists. None of the four operating points were tuned on the test. These are local classifiers, upstream of GPT.",
